# PYTHON-PRIMARY PROJECTS

## 1. AI Job Application Automation Platform

**Idea:** Automatically finds relevant job postings across multiple job portals, tailors your resume/answers using an LLM, and submits applications — removing the manual grind of job hunting.

**Architecture Split by Language**
| Language | Component | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| **Go** | Portal Orchestrator | Concurrently visits and polls *multiple job portals* (LinkedIn, Indeed, Naukri, etc.) on a schedule, using goroutines so checking 10+ sites doesn't happen one-by-one; pushes "new job found" events onto a Redis queue |
| **Python** | Scraper & LLM Worker | Pulls jobs off the queue; uses Selenium/Playwright to open the actual application form; calls an LLM API to tailor the resume/cover letter/answers to that specific posting; submits the form |
| **Redis** | Message Queue | The hand-off point between Go's orchestrator and Python's workers — decouples "finding jobs" from "applying to jobs" |

**Roadmap**
| Phase | Task | Language | Tech Stack |
|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Define target job portals & scope (which sites, what job titles/filters) | — | Planning only |
| 1 | Build the Python scraper for **one** portal first, fully working end-to-end | Python | Selenium/Playwright |
| 2 | Add LLM-based resume/answer tailoring to that single-portal flow | Python | OpenAI/Anthropic API, LangChain (optional) |
| 3 | Build the Go orchestrator that polls that one portal on a schedule | Go | net/http, goroutines, `time.Ticker` |
| 4 | Introduce Redis as the queue between Go (finds jobs) and Python (applies) | Go + Python | Redis, `go-redis`, `redis-py` |
| 5 | Extend the orchestrator to poll multiple portals concurrently | Go | Goroutines, worker pool pattern |
| 6 | Extend Python workers to handle each portal's different form structure | Python | Selenium/Playwright, per-site adapter pattern |
| 7 | Add retry logic + failure logging (a portal's layout changes, a form fails) | Go + Python | Structured logging, retry-with-backoff |
| 8 | Add a simple dashboard: jobs found, applications sent, success rate | Python (Streamlit) or JS (React) | Streamlit / React |
| 9 | Deploy: Go orchestrator + Redis + Python workers, containerized | Go + Python | Docker, Docker Compose |

